{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_04",
  "title": "The Great Aquapit",
  "storyCode": "IC-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1f3b59f8e2f97b1c644875581ad48866dca182d89a84c67ad9a493465560c005",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With the results of the referendum, the Great Aquapit will soon complete its historic half-year mission. It will be blown up and turned into construction material once again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Citizens, I'm afraid this slightly extended summer carnival will soon come to an end."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Durin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sobs*... I'll always remember our beautiful time together forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Durin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the super slide is so much fun, you can't get enough of it! I never thought we'd have to say goodbye..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However! In the Great Aquapit's place, we'll have an all-new, prettier, and completely different structure! After all, this is Zeruertza, a city built by the best architectural designers!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stitch Canvas and Catch Lightrace are two awe-inspiring, up-and-coming architectural designers. Over the next few months, the two of them will submit their design proposals..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Imagine the show showdown they have in store for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hehe, this brings me back to the dome design contest they had a few years ago, when they just made their debuts!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The duel ended all those years ago without a winner, but who will win the right to design Zeruertza's next landmark? Let us—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me get a sip of water first."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Edge Eartheart",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Croque, I've never seen you so enthusiastic. Have you been drinking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. Not yet, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Edge Eartheart",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_564_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now this isn't like you at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was watching videos of a competition on the surface that I got from Inam, and it seems they have a role called 'the MC'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought I might dip into a new career path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Anyhow! Although the architects' designs are yet to come, my fellow citizens, the tail end of our summer is going to be a fleeting one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Before the slide is blown up, let us enjoy it all we can!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Durin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ohhhh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gavial!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tomimi, watch out! Slow down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was so, so jealous when I heard you guys went to the waterfall in Acahualla!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hehe, and this time I get to join in on the fun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're such a kid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? What's wrong? You're usually so careful to hide your tail. Let's see... Did it get thicker again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh? Nope, not even a little! I checked with a measuring tape before I got here! It's been months since I got any thicker!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? Sounds like you're really hung up on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Waaaahhh... Eat my water blast!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh, you little runt! It's on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Avdotya",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're more like Durins than you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How would you know what it means to be 'Durin', Lupo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Avdotya",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You seem a little nervous. Are you worried about your contest with Catch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Worried? Over him? Don't make me laugh. I haven't fallen so low. It's just laypeople tend to like his proposals more."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mine get their fair share of fans, too. Perhaps I should be bringing something different to the table. That's how I'll win."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perhaps I should just... *sigh*! I should probably take my mind off of that right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To tell the truth... if we don't care about aesthetics and just look at how fun it is, this 'Great Aquapit' isn't so bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Avdotya",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, so you enjoy these things, too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Every now and then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stitch, you're here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Want to try out the slide with the downstream speed set to max? It wears the equipment out, so we don't usually get to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just tried it a couple times with Elysium. It was amazingly fast!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It does hurt a little when you hit the water, though. Still, wanna try?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, thanks. I'm not one bit interested in fun and games like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whooo! Bombs away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#14$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Catch, my brother! This impact force is on another level! Did you see how high that splash went?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe we should try something different. Say... see which of us can land with the tiniest splash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Keep the splashes small? Good idea! Sounds like it won't hurt nearly as bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My sand castle..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Hey, uh, Catch, did we perhaps... screw up?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Uh, even though this is Stitch we're talking about, he can't possibly be mad over a sand castle, right?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(He seems rather angry to me, though.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In that case, we should probably...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, where are you two going? You're just going to run? Get back here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yep, you did very well getting everyone going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have your video tapes to thank. That's where I picked it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Next, we can hold a series of contests to keep the enthusiasm that goes with this 'championship' contest going, then we'll use Catch and Stitch's design contest in a few months to pump everyone up to the max."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We could print some paper slips for the audience to use to show their support for one side, with prizes given to those who pick the right side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We call those lottery tickets. You're really good at picking things up. Up on the surface, there are merchants who line their pockets by selling them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We Durins don't much care for money in that way... Let's have the losing side pay for the winners' drinks for a month!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm, we could make it two months to make things more exciting, too. We'll have to decide with a referendum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Later on, perhaps we could issue some more lottery tickets covering how many months' worth of alcohol are owed in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm starting to worry about the Zeruertzans' future."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm, I'm not used to feeling unhelpful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "What's wrong? Do you have to beat something up to satisfy yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Still, if this goes well, Acahualla will get its hands on some Durin. Would've been a totally pointless trip otherwise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_572_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gavial may have left home a long time ago, but she actually really cares about Acahualla!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, I've been to so many different places, but the rainforest is the one place where I feel most at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you going to come back, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not planning on it. Not yet, at least. I still have lots of patients to take care of back at Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are plenty of Tiacauh who want you to go back. You could think about becoming their lord ameer, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, and they want bananas to sprout straight out of the soil, too. Can't always get what you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gavial, you would be the most fitting lord ameer for Acahualla. You are the only one who can rein in each and every Tiacauh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone is awaiting your return."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And if you simply cannot do it, then it's ultimately likely... that a lord ameer from the Court of Sargon will come to govern Acahualla instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And when that happens, Acahualla will no longer be the free land you knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But don't we already have you for our Great Chief?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are some things I can't do anything about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can come up with ideas to help get us in better shape, but I'm not the one who can really bring the Tiacauh together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not like I'm running away from responsibility here, Inam."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just... I haven't thought through how to actually do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "You know how to think? Color me surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, Zumama, you picking a fight?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "What I'm saying is, you usually do stuff without thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And that's fine when it's just me, but this is about all those Tiacauh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All good things must come to an end. Isn't that right? So this giant slide will be torn down for something new."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I actually didn't catch much of what you were talking about. All I want to say is, my friends, let me get a picture of all of you together while it's still standing."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha, alright, let's toss all this complicated stuff aside for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right now, we gotta have fun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tomimi, you gimme a smile, too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like you've mastered the Durin philosophy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, it's not often we get a vacation. As if I'm gonna waste it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well said! Here's to you! How about some berry tomato wine? It's on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nah, I'll have to pass on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My, what a graceful way to disappear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here I thought you would pass out from all that drink and miss the demolition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha, I know how to have a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Though, at times like these, I generally keep myself clearheaded."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's the most basic respect I have for things as they fade away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whoa, were you actually a secret genius? That would be such a cheap cliche, even in the Zeruertzan library."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, you little rascal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stitch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Catch..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's time we got serious. Let's both do our best, fair and square."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catch Lightrace",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shake hands if you agree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright... Out of the most basic respect for another Zeruertzan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_571_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say, you two actually get along pretty well, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What, are you blind?! Where'd you get that idea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, things are going to get real from here on out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stitch Canvas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4054_malist_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Has Croque been drinking...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The warm-up of warm-ups, the prelude to preludes! The first season of the Zeruertza Competition Series!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Drumroll*—Ta-dah! A swimming contest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croque Diamondface",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_566_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
